OUTCOME CLASSIFIED
CHECK ClassAssertion(<http://example.com/crm#Client> <http://example.org/dl-same-as-not-class-equivalence#alice>) NOT_ENTAILED
CHECK EquivalentClasses(<http://example.com/crm#Client> <http://example.org/dl-same-as-not-class-equivalence#Customer>) NOT_ENTAILED
CHECK SameIndividual(<http://example.com/crm#Client> <http://example.org/dl-same-as-not-class-equivalence#Customer>) ENTAILED
CHECK SubClassOf(<http://example.org/dl-same-as-not-class-equivalence#Customer> <http://example.com/crm#Client>) NOT_ENTAILED
SAME <http://example.com/crm#Client> <http://example.org/dl-same-as-not-class-equivalence#Customer>
TYPE <http://example.org/dl-same-as-not-class-equivalence#alice> <http://example.org/dl-same-as-not-class-equivalence#Customer>
